
🧮 Advanced GUI Calculator

An Advanced Calculator Application built using Python Tkinter, featuring both scientific calculations and unit conversion tools.
It provides a clean GUI with buttons for basic arithmetic, advanced math functions, and a dedicated tools section for conversions.

🚀 Features
🔢 Calculator Functions

Basic Operations – Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication, Division

Scientific Functions – Square, Square Root, Power, Logarithm, Trigonometry (sin, cos, tan, etc.)

Clear & Backspace – Modify or reset input easily

Keyboard Support – Input using both mouse and keyboard

Error Handling – Prevents crashes on invalid input (e.g., divide by zero)

🛠️ Advanced Tools Section

Time Conversion – Hours ↔ Minutes ↔ Seconds

Volume Conversion – Liters ↔ Milliliters ↔ Cubic Meters, etc.

Speed Conversion – Km/h ↔ m/s ↔ mph

Area Conversion – Sq.m ↔ Sq.ft ↔ Acres, etc.

Temperature Conversion – Celsius ↔ Fahrenheit ↔ Kelvin

🛠️ Tech Stack

Programming Language: Python

GUI Framework: Tkinter

Libraries Used:

math – For advanced mathematical operations

tkinter – For GUI design

⚙️ Workflow

User Input – Enter numbers via calculator buttons or type manually.

Computation – Calculator uses Python’s math library for results.

Unit Conversion (Tools Section)

User selects a tool (Time, Volume, Speed, Area, Temperature).

Enters the value in one unit.

App instantly converts it into other related units.

Output Display – Results shown in GUI output window.
